  "sobre": {
    "titulo": "ℹ️ About the data",
    "origenTitulo": "Where does the data come from?",
    "origenTexto": "The contracts come from the <a href=\"https://contrataciondelestado.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Public Sector Procurement Platform (PLACSP)</a>, the official portal of the Spanish Ministry of Finance where all public bodies must publish their tenders since <strong>Law 9/2017 on Public Sector Contracts</strong> came into force.",
    "procesoTitulo": "How is it processed?",
    "procesoTexto": "An automated pipeline downloads the PLACSP Atom feed every week, keeps the contracts of the <strong>Community of Madrid</strong>, normalises the fields (dates, amounts, names of contracting bodies), removes duplicates and generates the JSON file this website loads. All the code is public and auditable on <a href=\"https://github.com/albus-quinctus/ContratosCAM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitHub</a>.",
    "alcanceTitulo": "Which contracts are included?",
    "alcanceLista": "<li>Contracts published on PLACSP by bodies of the Community of Madrid.</li><li>All procedures: open, negotiated, restricted, minor, etc.</li><li>Both ongoing tenders (not yet awarded) and awarded contracts.</li><li><strong>Not included:</strong> minor contracts not published on PLACSP (below the publication thresholds).</li>",
    "frecuenciaTitulo": "How often is it updated?",
    "frecuenciaTexto": "The data is updated automatically every <strong>Monday</strong> through GitHub Actions. The date of the last update is shown at the top of the page.",
    "legalTitulo": "Legal framework",
    "legalTexto": "The data is in the public domain. Its reuse is covered by <a href=\"https://www.boe.es/buscar/act.php?id=BOE-A-2007-19814\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Law 37/2007</a> on the reuse of public sector information and <a href=\"https://www.boe.es/buscar/act.php?id=BOE-A-2013-12887\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Law 19/2013</a> on transparency, access to public information and good governance.",
    "erroresTitulo": "Found an error?",
    "erroresTexto": "Open an <a href=\"https://github.com/albus-quinctus/ContratosCAM/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">issue on GitHub</a> or contact the author. The data is shown exactly as published by the official source; errors in the original data cannot be fixed from this project."
  }
}
